          "current_price": 8699,
          "description_ar": "Four gorgeous colors. One durable design—Built to last with an aluminum unibody design featuring color-matched back glass for a more uniform look.\nImmersive pro display—A 6.3‑inch Super Retina XDR display. Brighter. Better antireflection. ProMotion up to 120Hz.\nDurable Ceramic Shield. Front and back—Built to last with Ceramic Shield back—and Ceramic Shield 2 front, with 3x better scratch resistance than iPhone 16 Pro.\nUltimate Pro camera system—48MP Fusion Main camera with variable aperture for improved low-light photos and video and impressive depth of field. Custom Pro controls. And 8x optical-quality zoom.\n18MP Center Stage front camera—Flexible ways to frame your shot. Fit more people in the picture. Front and rear Dual Capture video. And more.\nA20 Pro chip. Total AI powerhouse—With next-generation vapor chamber and Dual 16-core Neural Engine. Up to 40% better GPU performance than iPhone 17 Pro. Purpose-built for AI.\nBIG LEAP IN battery life—Up to 3 more hours video playback than iPhone 17 Pro. Up to 24 hours of use per charge. Faster wired charging, up to 50% in around 15 minutes with compatible adapter.\nAPPLE INTELLIGENCE—Personal, private, powerful. Write, express yourself, and get things done effortlessly.\nVITAL SAFETY FEATURES—With Crash Detection, iPhone can detect a severe car crash and call for help if you can’t.",
